        },
        {
          "id": 3296231991,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "We have wmem_array_sized_new, which would work here. It looks like we only use wmem_array_try_index in the MQ dissector; I'm surprised we don't use that in more places.\n\nOne downside is that we'd lose type checking between the file parser and dissector, although I'm not sure that's a big deal in this case.",
          "author": {
            "id": 860017,
            "username": "geraldcombs",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Gerald Combs",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/860017/avatar.png?v=1788740758",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/geraldcombs"
          },
          "created_at": "2026-04-28T19:11:09.320Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-04-29T07:51:38.511Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 479018473,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
